            "review_text": "Passenger39557754815\nBen Luc, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nTuyệt vời\nOct 2025 • Family\nToday I had a meal at Chilli Thai, and I have to say the dishes here really suited my taste. The menu offers a wide variety of dishes suitable for all ages. I especially enjoyed the Pad Thai and the traditional Tom Yum soup – they had the perfect balance of sour and spicy, rich with authentic Thai flavors. The drinks and desserts were also delicious. The restaurant has a spacious layout and attractive decor. The staff were friendly, attentive, and lovely. If you're looking to experience Thai cuisine, you should definitely check out Chilli Thai.\"\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2025",
